                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 3.0 GHz Quad Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 650M (1GB GDDR5) / Intel Iris graphics or better<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 1 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Unsupported video chipsets: Intel HD Graphics 3000, Intel GMA X3100, Intel GMA 950. This game is not supported on volumes formatted as Mac OS Extended Journaled (case sensitive)</li></ul>"
